        "contentHtml": "<strong>Course Objectives:</strong><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 4px;\"><strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🎓</span> General Objective:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Develop the ability to understand and apply [describe the general objective of the course]. <span aria-hidden=\"true\">📌</span> By the end, the student is expected to be able to [expected result].</p><p style=\"margin: 8px 0 4px;\"><strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\">✅</span> Specific Objectives:</strong></p><ol style=\"text-align: justify;\"><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📖</span> [Specific objective 1];</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">💡</span> [Specific objective 2];</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🧩</span> [Specific objective 3];</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔬</span> [Specific objective 4];</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🗓️</span> [Specific objective 5];</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🚀</span> [Specific objective 6].</li></ol>"
