        "borderRadius": 6,
        "hoverEffect": "none",
        "contentHtml": "<strong>Methodology:</strong><p style=\"text-align: justify; margin-top: 8px;\">The course is organized into <strong>[N] thematic weeks</strong>, with teaching strategies that combine synchronous and asynchronous moments:</p><ul style=\"text-align: justify;\"><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📡</span> <strong>[N] live synchronous sessions</strong> — dates to be defined;</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📝</span> <strong>Weekly graded forums</strong> — reflection and debate on the content;</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📚</span> <strong>Reading of digital material, ebooks and video lessons</strong> — available in the LMS;</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">❓</span> <strong>Questions Forum</strong> open every week;</li><li><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📋</span> <strong>Final Exam</strong> — covering all chapters.</li></ul>"
      }
